  "_comment": "Cross-language oracle for the group-membership export. cli/gh-teacher/internal/groupcmd (buildRows + defangCells) and web/src/domain/submissions/groupMembershipCsv.ts (buildGroupMembershipCsvRows) must both reproduce every case's `rows` byte for byte, in `columns` order, and both must map `default_name` inputs to its outputs. Members carry an optional GitHub `id`; `fallback: true` marks a member derived from the repository name (a legacy founder) rather than a live read; `members: null` is an unreadable group, `[]` a group with no members yet. Roster `github_id` cells are the raw roster.csv text: both readers resolve a zero-padded id and treat anything non-numeric as unresolved.",
